+mkdir - create directory
+
+<h3>Synopsis</h3>
+/bin/mkdir <em>directory</em>
+
+<h3>Description</h3>
+
+mkdir creates the named directory. All intermediate components must
+already exist. If the named directory already exists, an error occurs.
+
+<h3>Requirements</h3>
